but for quantum mechanics

00:46:44.935 --> 00:46:47.571
and for waves, like electrons.

00:46:47.571 --> 00:46:48.838
And I'm going to describe them.

00:46:48.838 --> 00:46:52.475
So he developed the
equation that we

00:46:52.475 --> 00:46:56.012
